<title>USA: U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 8.890 million bushels of U.S. soybeans inspected for export in the week ended Sept 19 were for the following destinations (1,000 bushels):</p>
<p>Mississippi River to: Taiwan, 3,491; Japan 2,181; Germany 1,835; Netherlands 317</p>
<p>Columbia River to Philippines 582</p>
<p>Interior to Mexico 484.</p>
</text>
